      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "FLAMING SAPPHIRE (2) progressive type who recorded her 6th career win last time out (19.90) at Q Lakeside. Tends to go well off this box draw. Has a good overall strike-rate and shapes as a leading player on best. RICKY BOBBY (1) turned in a moderate effort last time when sixth at this track over 366m behind Mr. O'malley (20.56) in a Grade 4/5. Was in the money the start prior. Form from his last run is proving to be solid. Expected to feature in the finish. TOP EIGHT (3) pinged the lids and was in the firing line throughout but drifted out of it when 7th at this track in a Grade 4/5. Solid record here at the distance winning four races. Will give the top chances plenty to think about. MISS RIGHTEOUS (5) is in the mix after placing at a big quote last time out.",
